  "conversion_adaptations": [
    "Final independently re-evaluates the two source feedback workloads together with the two source graded workloads to satisfy T35; no workload shape or seed was invented.",
    "T41 production correction raises formal and short Agent/Verifier resources and the evaluator OpenMP worker count from 2 to 8; workloads, timing boundary, scoring, reference, repeats and PASS relation are unchanged.",
    "Common runtime-cap repair sets max_model_request_bytes to 67108864 (64 MiB) in formal and short releases; task science and evaluator behavior are unchanged.",
    "Beat spec v2 (2026-10-07) adds the paper's Table 3 sequential time T1 as a second per-workload beating metric (one-thread runtime, same C <= 0.97R rule) measured in a separate pass after the unchanged eight-thread pass, and routes reference or trusted-workload failures to a failed verification; workloads, eight-thread timing, score and budgets are unchanged."
